  "statement": "Let \\(A B C D\\) be a quadrilateral inscribed in a circle with diameter \\(\\overline{A D}\\). If \\(A B=5, A C=6\\), and \\(B D=7\\), find \\(C D\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
