      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-guts-2014-p7.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(\\sqrt{38}\\) We have \\(A D^{2}=A B^{2}+B D^{2}=A C^{2}+C D^{2}\\), so \\(C D=\\sqrt{A B^{2}+B D^{2}-A C^{2}}=\\sqrt{38}\\).",
